# Kubernetes override of config/trino/etc/jvm.config.
#
# Identical to the Compose file except -Xmx512M (Compose uses -Xmx2G). The kind cluster runs the
# whole platform on one node, so a 2 GB Trino heap starves the Spark, Kafka, and HDFS pods sharing
# it. Paired with the query memory caps in overrides/trino-config.properties.
#
# One of exactly three files that legitimately differ between runtimes -- see docs/kubernetes.md.
-server
-Xmx512M
-XX:+UseG1GC
-XX:G1HeapRegionSize=32M
-XX:+ExplicitGCInvokesConcurrent
-XX:+ExitOnOutOfMemoryError
